pve-tools (1.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the pve-tools bundle, provided as an
    alternative installation method for Proxmox VE nodes. Bundled tools:
    - pve-import-cloud-images 1.3.0
    - pve-vmnic-fix 1.0.0
    - pve-create-tshoot-image 1.3.0
    - pve-sdn-healthcheck 1.0.0
  * Install scripts to /usr/sbin, man pages to /usr/share/man/man8,
    and bash completion to /usr/share/bash-completion/completions.

 -- Ciro Iriarte <ciro.iriarte+software@gmail.com>  Fri, 05 Jun 2026 09:03:12 -0300
